      "created_at": "2018-06-04T20:57:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Their reactions to my deluge of meat puns was&nbsp;<em>almost</em> exactly what I had hoped for, with Adam moaning and writhing while Christopher chortled with suppressed glee.&nbsp; I did hope they'd say that such a universe couldn't possibly exist, though--Adam because he never wants to be asked to draw it, and Christopher because they'd already established that the Iron Legacy timeline was the&nbsp;<em>wurst</em>.</p>",
